/**
 * How Sendai bamboo and sparrows (`sendai-zasa`) is constructed, in a line in each language: the text a crest's card shows beside its steps.
 * It is here, not on the crest's record, so that the manifest stays small; `crestConstruction()` loads it.
 *
 * @example
 * ```ts no-run
 * import { description } from "@johnmorrisdotca/kamon-crests/steps/sendai-zasa";
 *
 * console.log(description.en.length > 30, description.ja.endsWith("。")); // true true
 * ```
 */
const description: { en: string; ja: string } = {"en":"A ring of bamboo with long leaves outside it and two sparrows inside, beak to beak. The ring is the band between two circles about a point on the axis a little under the centre, with a white joint across it on each of two lines ruled through that point and two short white lines of grain by each joint. At the top the two stalks' ends cross: two white lines ruled across the ring, crossing on the axis. Under the ring stand the cut ends of the two stalks, between upright lines, two joints across each, with a notch between them. Outside the ring are seven leaves a side: pairs an eighth of a turn apart, and one leaf by each stalk's end. A leaf is the lens between two circles of one width, with a white vein down its middle; a small leaf of the same kind lies inside the ring over each sparrow. Each sparrow lies between a circle about the ring's centre and a wider circle struck from the other side. Round its head is a band of scales, white dots in two rows, and then a white line. Over the head the wing is raised: a fan of five feathers, the white lines between them ruled from the head's centre to points three apart on a level line, each feather ending in a round tip of one width. The tail has two white stripes, each between two circles about the back's centre. The eye is a white disc with a dot, and the beak is ruled from its point by the axis. The ring is built first, then the leaves where they stand, clockwise, then the right sparrow, and the left sparrow where it stands.","ja":"竹の輪の外に長い笹の葉を置き、中に二羽の雀を向かい合わせた紋です。輪は、中心より少し下の、中心線の上の一点を中心とする二つの円の間の帯です。その点を通る二本の直線の上に白い節を入れ、節のそばに、短い白い線を二本ずつ入れます。上では二本の竹の先が交差します。輪を横切る白い線二本を、中心線の上で交わるように引きます。輪の下には、二本の竹の切り口が、縦の直線の間に立ち、それぞれに節が二つあり、間に切れ込みがあります。輪の外の葉は片側に七枚です。二枚ひと組を45度ずつ離して置き、竹の切り口のそばには一枚だけ置きます。葉は、同じ幅の円二つが重なるレンズ形で、まん中に白い葉脈を一本通します。同じ作りの小さい葉を、輪の中の、雀の上に一枚ずつ置きます。雀は、輪の中心を中心とする円と、反対側から描いた広い円の間にあります。頭のまわりに、白い点を二列に並べたうろこの帯があり、その外に白い線が一本あります。頭の上には、上げた翼があります。羽根五枚の扇で、羽根の間の白い線は、頭の中心から、横の線の上に3ずつ離した点へ引いた直線です。羽根の先は、同じ幅の円で丸くします。尾には白いしまが二本あり、どちらも、背の円と同じ中心の二つの円の間です。目は点のある白い円で、くちばしは、中心線のそばの先から直線を引きます。輪を先に作図し、葉を時計回りに一組ずつその場で作図し、右の雀を作図してから、左の雀をその場で作図します。"};

export default construction;
export { construction, description };
